    <string name="phone_pc_agent_title">pc agent</string>
    <string name="phone_pc_agent_about">a coding agent on your computer (claude code, omp) can read the widgets folder (your widgets\' files and the docs), write, delete and check widgets and apps there, and see its own as the phone draws them. it reaches the phone from your wi-fi or another private network, or tailscale, and needs the token below. while the screen is off, android may hold its connections. unless you allow commands, the rest of the phone stays closed to it.</string>
