    <string name="phone_pc_agent_commands">widgets that run commands</string>
    <string name="phone_pc_agent_commands_off">refused · its widgets can show things and use servers on the internet, but not run linux commands, read files, notifications or apps, act as you, or reach the phone or your home network. it checks only widgets it wrote, and one it puts in place of yours starts without your widget\'s saved values</string>
